    "traits": "Consumable Herb",
    "description": "<strong>Usage held in 1 hand; Activate Interact (2 AP).</strong>\n\nTerrain: temperate or cold moors.\n\nWitchgrass grows in uneven circles across lonely moors, its grey-green blades always leaning away from the nearest settlement. Dew caught upon it tastes strongly of salt, and livestock refuse to graze where it flourishes. Bundles are dried above cold iron and burned during curse-breaking rites, giving off a sharp smoke that clings to hair and clothing. For 1 hour, you gain a +2-item bonus to saving throws against curses.\n\nPillars of Faith, Chapter 6.",
